  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Facility for Solid Waste Management and Circular Economy (GloW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A concept note is drafted by GGGI/AFD and submitted to GCF on setting up a global finance facility for solid waste management and circular economy. The project is led by GGGI with support from AFD, using Jordan and Rwanda as pilot countries for project identification. AFD will contribute financially (USD40,000) under our global MOU</narrative>
  </description>
